      "type": "open_ended",
      "question": "How has the regulatory approach to raw material management in bonded warehouses transitioned since the introduction of the Warehouse Licensing Rules 2024?",
      "answer": "The regulatory framework has evolved from basic procedural guidelines toward a highly structured, digitized, and audit-centric system. As evidenced by the 2025 Audit Rules and the 2025-09-29 SRO 384/2025, the system now emphasizes automated utilization permits, standardized reporting of waste and consumption coefficients, and strict enforcement of export timelines linked to import privileges.",
